00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:51.700
Chapter 17 Hollow

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.040
Where... am I?

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:15.470
Where in the world is this place?

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.300
What was all that?

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.290
Just a dream...

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.230
Well, if it isn't Tetsu.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:55.400
Mr. Okita...

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.480
What on earth are you doing up so late?

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:06.080
What about you, Mr. Okita?
What are <i>you </i>doing?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.980
Oh, I just couldn't fall asleep.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:14.160
You seem rather down, Tetsu.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:19.330
Well, I just had a really scary dream.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:24.510
It was really scary, and when I woke up,
I heard something outside...

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:27.410
I see.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:30.850
As for me, there's something
that's been bothering me...

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.870
We have a message for Kondo!

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.620
He is to present himself at once

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.130
to explain the outrage committed
against the Mimawarigumi!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:55.700
And you are saying it was Soji Okita
who cut down his companions?

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:59.410
We have witnesses as well.
There is no mistake.

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:02.040
This is a serious defection.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.580
With all due respect,

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:07.840
Soji was in my room until late last night.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:11.760
Your man is an impostor
assuming Soji's name.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.160
Be that as it may,

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.790
if someone is assuming the
name of the First Unit Captain,

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:18.560
we cannot let it lie.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:23.760
We will find the culprit without
delay and hand him over to you.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:24.780
Will that be satisfactory?

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.900
Very well, then.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.410
Masuya

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.410
Regarding the arrangements we discussed...

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:35.540
We are in the process of preparing
the weaponry right now.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:41.040
In order to unleash fire upon the capital as
planned and burn down the imperial palace,

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.470
we still do not have enough grenades.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.550
Since ancient times, fire comes
first when attacking castles.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:52.410
Taking advantage of that confusion,
we will seize the Emperor

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:56.120
and strike down Katamori Matsudaira
while he is in a panic.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.020
I will not allow those
Mibu ronin to interfere!

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:03.980
The long-awaited desire of the
Choshu will be granted soon.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.830
Indeed.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:11.740
Once we have the Emperor in
our hands, we will be in the right.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.370
You...

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:19.460
Where did you get in from?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.250
What'll I do...?

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.580
<i>Well, I wonder why...</i>

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.680
<i>Maybe it's so that I can kill people.</i>

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.830
I heard some Mimawarigumi
members were killed near this area.

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:51.750
Are you serious?

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:55.260
Word is the culprit's
Captain Okita of the Shinsengumi!

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:59.500
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.710
<i>Oh? That girl...</i>

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.990
You, there! Wait!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.500
It <i>is </i>you!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.750
Let's see... Miss Hotaru, right?

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:12.720
Uh, yes.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.560
But we saw each other just yesterday.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.250
Yesterday?
Remember?

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:24.790
On the bank of Kamo River,
you gave this to me.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.810
I... did?

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:30.900
Um, that was the real you, wasn't it?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.200
He was an impostor?!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:45.000
It seems there is someone assuming my
name and going around killing people.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:49.080
So, was this person that much like me?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.410
Yes...

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.450
Oh! I mean, no...

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.510
There is no need for you to be concerned...

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:58.410
No, I was being stupid!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:00.600
For me to mistake someone else for you...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.050
I'm sorry.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.090
Soji, are you here?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.330
Soji!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:23.870
Are you all right?

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.090
You?!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.270
Not bad. I see you're not
Vice Commander for nothing.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.950
Surprised?

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:43.810
I'm going to need you to die now.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:48.200
Quite the looker, aren't you?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.770
You're my type of guy.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.480
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.280
Vice Commander, I have come to your aid.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:07.000
Well, well. The spitting
image of Okita, is it?

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.540
How funny.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.160
Damn, you had to get in my way.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.590
I'll kill you along with him!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.680
How dare you...?

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.230
Damn bastard ran.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.000
Hey, who are you?!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.400
Hold it!

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.620
That bastard was fast.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.500
He was wearing our uniform...

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.670
Could it be...?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:53.290
What's going on, Mr. Hijikata?

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.290
Soji!

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.630
If you're fine, that's all that matters.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:03.700
I hope you're not suspecting
that I'm the impostor.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.410
As a matter of fact, Okita,

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:11.520
that very impostor appeared
while you were out on patrol.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:12.850
What?

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:17.790
He was quite the skilled swordsman.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.700
You be certain to be on your guard as well.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.270
I see...

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:43.390
Damn it, now I've been scarred.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:50.000
Be still. I am applying the ointment.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.890
You are truly beautiful.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:58.580
If Saneakira were alive,
he would be just about your age.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.620
Whoa, there, your lordship!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.490
The sun hasn't even set yet.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:08.410
My prince, you have grown
into such a fine young man.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:12.500
Do not say a word. I am
dreaming right now...

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.000
You're giving me the creeps!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:19.130
I'm not this Prince whatshisname,
nor am I your lover.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:20.440
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:24.250
You are right...

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:27.720
All I have in my hands are illusions...

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.120
How pitiable...

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:37.660
That child played in this room and passed away
without ever seeing outside this residence.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.700
Scorned as an illegitimate child,

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.870
and without even prayers at his funeral...

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:48.620
With these hands I cared for him,
and with these hands I buried him.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.750
Destroy this country for me!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.370
I have no powers at my disposal,

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.630
but I will at least give you this body!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:06.580
Kichisaburo, will you grant me my wish?

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:08.510
All right, your lordship.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:11.290
So, what do I have to do?

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.250
Fire will spread across the capital soon.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.650
I will show you the way
to the imperial palace.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:20.240
There, you must assassinate the Lord.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:25.540
Leave your discussions for later, my lord.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:29.130
A number of intruders
will be arriving shortly.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.410
I don't like this.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.750
Just who is it pulling
the strings behind him?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.790
I don't really know,

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:44.280
but if their objective is to tarnish
the Shinsengumi's reputation,

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:46.050
it has a rather disquieting
aura to it for that.

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.040
I have it.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:54.140
The enemy is likely a faction that
has mastered esoteric incantations.

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:56.430
What? Those people...

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.540
Yes, I sense it.

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.690
Their eerie aura...

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.360
Which means we have no choice but to go.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.670
Gallant Master Okita...

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.830
Mr. Hijikata, look!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.630
It's a cat.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.590
Okita, you must not strike it!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.190
Where... is this place?!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.870
It seems we have fallen into a trap.

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:51.160
This is likely within
the enemy's residence.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.910
I have no doubt this is that
Onmyo mystic from some time ago.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.330
If this is the Eight-Element
Battle Formation,

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.410
the enemy would seem to
seriously intend to kill us.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:01.420
How can you know that?

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:06.750
Lure the prey into the formation,
confuse them and make them go crazy.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.500
The Eight-Element Battle
Formation is the incantation

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:13.050
that Zhuge Liang used long ago
to annihilate the enemy's forces.

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.640
Damn it! The bastard uses peculiar spells.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:19.540
We will get nowhere by just standing here.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.530
We seem to have no choice
but to enter those gates.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:25.480
Master Okita!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.620
What is this?

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.210
It's like some sort of house of tricks...

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:48.840
We seem to have fallen
into a new incantation.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:57.550
The Gate of Obstruction?!

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.620
Let us get out.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.330
There should be an exit here.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.610
The Gate of Life somewhere.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:21.040
Wander to your hearts' content,
you cursed Mibu ronin.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.830
You cannot so easily escape the
Eight-Element Battle Formation.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:29.130
What awaits you is the Gate of Death!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:36.660
What'll I do?

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:41.360
No! Master Okita may be in trouble
inside right this very minute!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.640
What...

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:51.820
is this?

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.700
There!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:00.790
Huh? It opened...

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.080
Oh, well!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.290
Why?!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.210
I peeled this one off too,
since it was in the way.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.950
It's so dirty!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:18.760
I'm so glad I didn't take off my sandals.

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.480
Is this the Gate of Death?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.130
That monster from before!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.870
It's a child's room.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:08.200
We cannot fight it like this!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.370
This is a bad situation.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:13.820
In this strange place,
our abilities are powerless.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.330
I'll just peel this one off too!

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.120
No!

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:41.000
The Eight-Element Battle Formation!

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.100
It was you, after all.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:48.770
So, this is it.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.480
You will not get away with this.

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.900
He escaped...

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:04.780
You guys sure are an odd bunch,
coming all the way here just to get killed.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.040
So you're...

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:12.790
Allow me a belated introduction.
I am Kichisaburo of Yogotoya.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.190
I shall be sending you gentlemen
off on your final journey.

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.400
Stay away...

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.850
And you, are you man or evil spirit?

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.160
Man or evil spirit?

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.370
Why, I'm a man.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:34.270
Though a killer of man, who loves to kill!

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:40.450
You filthy, cursed Mibu ronin!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.000
It is over for the capital!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.660
I shall burn it to the ground!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.640
He's mad.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:53.960
This is great.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:57.630
Shoot more at them!

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:02.430
Burn more!

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.520
Hey, you okay?

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.410
My robe!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:30.580
It is burning... Burning... It is burning!

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:43.290
I feel sorry for them somehow.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.200
He was a crazy bastard.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:47.040
Don't think on it.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.790
Come on, we're going back.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:51.350
Master Okita!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.270
Miss Hotaru...

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.410
Master Okita...

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.860
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.910
I'm so sorry!

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:05.160
It's all right.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.530
I was unable to help you at all...

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:13.120
No, you undid those seals for us, remember?

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.450
What? Those talismans?

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:19.920
Thank you.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.870
You are a good maiden.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:25.170
The business of a spy does not suit you.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:27.450
What?!

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:30.050
Now, let us go back.

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:37.660
<i>Even Master Okita knew?</i>

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:39.580
<i>I'm so...</i>

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:50.070
Hotaru loved Master Okita very much!

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
<i>Gripping the microphone tight,
the hit parade's on parade</i>

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, how you feeling?</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.790
<i>Quite the gentleman when he's off stage</i>

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, a generous spirit too!</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:23.320
<i>Being such an honest guy,
even his life's plain</i>

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:27.290
<i>Keep building it up patiently</i>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:31.290
<i>May your dreams come true honestly</i>

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>Let's go for it again today, Jimmy</i>

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:40.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:44.630
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:52.550
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:11.950
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:20.000
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:29.170
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.160 --> 00:23:28.290
<i>Master, the rain...</i>

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:30.370
<i>Those who
doze with their sentiments held close,</i>

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:32.010
<i>and those who shed their blood...</i>

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:33.640
